      "writtenOn": "2024-05-23T21:53:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, if a PDC conforms to the spec, it\u0027s supposed to set only connector_change for async events. That\u0027s not what the rts54xx driver is doing but we can make it do so. Then nobody would need to set vendor_defined_indicator as a mask or the PDM would not need to check it in pdc_ci_handler_cb.\n\nHow do we want to proceed?",
